{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-10T22:22:17.883Z","data":{"text":"Task complete.\n\n**Summary**\n\nThe task's verify passes (3/3) and the proposal's `pnpm verify` exits 0 (3845 CLI tests + 157 UI tests, lint clean).\n\nThe change makes a clean `osq lint <id>` keep the change's traceability link findings on its `plan_ready` record:\n\n- `LintResult` gains optional `traceability`; `lintChangeFolder` captures the `collectTraceabilityFindings` list, still adds each to the own findings, and returns it.\n- `PlanReadyRecord.data` gains optional `traceability`, parsed only when the key is an array and dropping malformed entries, so existing readers see the same objects as before.\n- `recordPlanReady` takes the findings as an optional argument and writes the key only when the list is non-empty.\n- `src/cli/lint.ts` passes the findings through.\n- New `tests/plan-ready-traceability.test.ts` proves the three spec-lint-and-approve scenarios through `lintCommand` with captured writers and through `readPlanReady` on hand-written lines."}}
